    "catalogue_description": "Description This is my first map and is kind of an experiment to ease my way into map making so it isn\u2019t a very big map. Story: You and your squad are flying over Russia when when your planes randomly fail and you crash next to a strange house in the middle of the forest. You decide to take refuge inside the home but you soon find out that it was a big mistake. It turns out the house has a zombie infestation problem and you are the perfect meal for them so you\u2019ll have to fight off the undead for as long as you can. Includes: Der Riese Style Map All 4 perk machines Pack-a-Punch Tom_Bmx Music Box Buyable Max Ammo No Dog Rounds No Carpenter Drops Zombie Counter Known Bugs/Glitches: Can hop over the barrier leading to juggernaut (Oops) spanking1",
